name prosocial-dialog-dialogues
# A JSON object on every line. The dataset card: `context` "the potentially unsafe utterance"; `safety_label` "the
# final verdict of the context"; `safety_annotations` "raw annotations from three workers". So an object is the
# thing its "context" names, and every other member is said of it under its own key.
match train.json test.json valid.json
grammar json
records
identity * context
